    "detailed_description": "<strong> On that day, mankind remembered the fear of being dominated by the math Olympiad in primary school. </strong><br><br>Four random numbers, three operations, 24 points!<br><br>The 24-dot game is a simple and fun math game in which the goal is to make the result of four numbers equal to 24 by adding, subtracting, multiplying, and dividing four operations (each operation can be used any number of times). This game can not only exercise the player's calculation ability and logical thinking, but also improve the player's sensitivity to numbers and operators.<br><br>Here are the rules of the game:<br><br>There are four numbers in the game, each between 1 and 9.<br>Players need to add, subtract, multiply, and divide four operations so that the result of these four numbers is equal to 24.<br>Each number can only be used once and must be used in full.<br>Players are free to adjust the order of numbers, but the result must be equal to 24.<br><br>If you like math games can join us QQ group number: 494130141",
